    <item>
      <title>1.4.0</title>
      <description><![CDATA[Recovery you can trust. A restore timeline for browsing a library's versions and bringing one back, badges showing how thoroughly each version was checked, and a guided four-step recovery for a new Mac that rebuilds every library as it was at one moment. Plus a dashboard advisor naming libraries no job covers, and scheduled runs that wait when the battery is low.]]></description>
